  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECommunal cycle parking provision for newly proposed schools \u003Cstrong\u003Emust:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprovide a minimum 30% of spaces that are Sheffield-type stands that \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Ebe supplied to cover all provisions \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eincorporate a minimum of 5% of stands at 1 metre spacing to accommodate non-standard and adapted cycles, such as accessible bikes, scooters and cargo bikes \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ebe covered and located within 50 metres of the primary entrance \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ebe well-overlooked and lit to maintain passive surveillance and user safety \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ehave safe and segregated access from motorised transport \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprovide a floor- or wall-mounted public bike pump (gas powered) where more than 40 cycle spaces are provided \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprovide a public bike pump and repair tool station where more than 80 spaces are provided \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eensure that staff cycle parking is separate and located near the staff block to provide convenient access to showering facilities \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Enot be accessed through, form part of, or be directly adjacent to any waste storage area\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
